<title>SPAIN: Fecsa '96 net profit 13.51 bln ptas-source.</title>
<headline>Fecsa '96 net profit 13.51 bln ptas-source.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Fuerzas Electricas de Catalunya (Fecsa) group posted net profit of 13.51 billion pesetas in 1996 versus 15.39 billion pesetas the year earlier, an industry source said on Friday.</p>
<p>Fecsa was unable to immediately confirm the figures.</p>
<p>The source said he received the profit and loss account from Endesa, which has a majority stake in Fecsa.  </p>
<p>The source provided the following figures:</p>
<p>					    1996    vs    1995</p>
<p>Net turnover			   240.76   vs   231.05</p>
<p>Operating profit			51.22   vs   49.99</p>
<p>Ordinary profit			 15.39   vs   11.83</p>
<p>Profit before tax		     16.26   vs   16.21</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
